{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "静岡県出身\n櫻坂46 大沼晶保です🐟🌻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遅くなってしまいましたが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "4月11、12日　MUFGスタジアム（国立競技場）にて開催された5th YEAR ANNIVERSARY LIVE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "会場に足を運んでくださったみなさん\n配信を観てくださったみなさん"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5歳のお誕生日を一緒にお祝いしてくださり本当にありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobG3I20U.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobHwtcGs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広かったね〜想像の7倍ぐらい広かった！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "でもでも！\nみなさんの顔は表情までしっかり見えました👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一生忘れない"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "忘れたくない景色でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob02K5Zz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特に国立で披露させていただけた\n「青空が見えるまで」\nいつも以上に歌詞がすごく沁みました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "〝今自分にできること\n何か探せばいい〟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46のために自分には今何ができるか\n探し続けた5年間でした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "迷うこともあったけど、\nそれでもたくさん探して\n何度でも挑戦しました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その原動力はいつだってBuddiesでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5年間毎日Buddiesを笑顔にしたいって思っていたって胸を張って言えます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんなに大雨の日でも立っていられたのは\nBuddiesがいつも隣にいてくれて\n1人じゃなかったからです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Buddiesのみなさんと\nここにこれて本当に幸せでした！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にありがとう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6年目もいっぱいいっぱい頑張りますので\n応援よろしくお願いします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大好きだよ🍀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "衣装可愛すぎた〜〜〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpV5ldc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobjGRaZi.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/moblpKv3b.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobdTRShB.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobJtObvN.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobVTmJBM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobpz7Mq0.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "唯衣ちゃんのダントラ本当にすごかったな〜✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いっぱいいっぱい時間をかけて愛を込めて\nつくってくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まじカッケェ！！！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本番晴れてよかった〜"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrcWUoS.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リハは大雨だったよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobf9o4Ll.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🦖☔️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また書きます〜！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あきぽ🐟"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobohRHN1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなたは185cm沼にはまりました"}], "source": "official"}